{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（5日）早上11時12分，沙田石門京瑞廣場地下一間賣兩餸飯的食肆冒出大量濃煙，驚動多人報案。消防到場撲救，約21分鐘後救熄，救護車在場戒備，暫無受傷報告。從網上影片可見，店舖冒出大量濃煙，席捲半空，籠罩港鐵石門站外的街道，途人紛紛走避。</p><figure><img alt=\"店舖冒出的濃煙相當誇張，籠罩整段路面。（Threads/@lk_music121）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172877613597724672360917.jpeg/YBkszuJZsSLBZ9Uw8S4pnANjj3DnLDT1h2TQJIdk0CQ\"/><figcaption>店舖冒出的濃煙相當誇張，籠罩整段路面。（Threads/@lk_music121）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店舖冒出的濃煙相當誇張，籠罩整段路面。（Threads/@lk_music121）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172877615841808384382756.jpeg/PhhnBjhxzRCq56TIs0vNLGCZAiCV_F3cVWWhl1VloZc\"/><figcaption>店舖冒出的濃煙相當誇張，籠罩整段路面。（Threads/@lk_music121）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店舖冒出的濃煙相當誇張，籠罩整段路面。（Threads/@lk_music121）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172877617926508544196542.jpeg/ClMFxxtjddFxbVSGAjVgKQVNJ1jVjhJoWiIEi1oiBIs\"/><figcaption>店舖冒出的濃煙相當誇張，籠罩整段路面。（Threads/@lk_music121）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店舖冒出的濃煙相當誇張，籠罩整段路面。（Threads/@lk_music121）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172877619986042880893170.jpeg/bwJKLOd4su2lfVjF3Vk2-yGY-aozTuKuhsyTBIbMkwQ\"/><figcaption>店舖冒出的濃煙相當誇張，籠罩整段路面。（Threads/@lk_music121）</figcaption></figure><p>現場是一間賣兩餸飯的食店。消防經初步調查後相信，店內燒味爐長期運作產生高溫，今早煮食期間過熱，故產生大量油煙並經抽油煙機系統排出街外。事故觸發消防花灑系統及煙霧探測器，經花灑系統灑水約10分鐘後，燒味爐已自行降溫。現場未有失火，消防人員只於現場開喉戒備。</p><p>其間濃煙攻入商場，港鐵石門站亦有煙湧至，多人自行疏散，幸無人受傷；其後後濃煙逐漸消散。</p><figure><img alt=\"途人匆匆走避。（threadster_b7kd8fai截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172878281272201216480516.jpeg/jYp0hCs2_sVaC3aOh60o6Os9Cz1ViJwzWQZxnVkGcZ0\"/><figcaption>途人匆匆走避。（threadster_b7kd8fai截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"途人匆匆走避。（threadster_b7kd8fai截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172878283512090624824096.jpeg/SeDN_f9tkWgQIqCgNTzmNWryEB-202b6rZnJQa2ZyUE\"/><figcaption>途人匆匆走避。（threadster_b7kd8fai截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"途人匆匆走避。（threadster_b7kd8fai截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172878285663899648247506.jpeg/RAa0xvZv9XTKt9dIEMAhddFbaJ4qYAMcHq9aDx6vWg8\"/><figcaption>途人匆匆走避。（threadster_b7kd8fai截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石門站亦有濃煙攻入。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172881837572231168094832.jpeg/PAcgN91QDpLzBG_Rih7nKCj3OHNo-czLn07u3J9O7tw\"/><figcaption>石門站亦有濃煙攻入。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172875433117487104539640.jpeg/0DxzyXLY5Cpk09UUysC01RL4Vdw5rIlNi9DstYvQ7LU\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方及消防在場調查事件起因。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172878880483053568537940.jpeg/sARPArwqiZHL3-VoM83zixMReO0qW8jASPcO0Uj3DtE\"/><figcaption>警方及消防在場調查事件起因。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172879352803627008634105.jpeg/-w0ohUDbu--lT6B1gWJOqWiFCPJDIBICxsZuIMbGbiA\"/><figcaption>警方在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店舖有物件掉在地上。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172879355580387328389724.jpeg/zioIPMIFRo63JMX6dAOzEMySxUSZja6MNnOYpDZzmKQ\"/><figcaption>店舖有物件掉在地上。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172879358113878016082715.jpeg/MU-RBhmfwGBbiW7fa2j-Q46ZLn4183m5dDrG9HQ6xvQ\"/><figcaption>警方在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172879360949358592063297.jpeg/UyXFDbIOqc266vlrZdDnak578GGcmKQXwgMyisIDMoo\"/><figcaption>警方在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方及消防在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172879363554152448285736.jpeg/FUCiFh6ydWzvW6dgCbxTpR3kKYF99k26kDNvVZAzb1U\"/><figcaption>警方及消防在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172879351666970624428953.jpeg/mo4qZrJqHrci5ufPOYBiP91ywyq7fuujz_hgP8_4YD8\"/><figcaption>警方在場了解情況。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172878883251425280678214.jpeg/J2kcOyQLiC5iTDs0GDdBm684sqhyAq9DWXVmmFl1Zpg\"/><figcaption>消防到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T08:40:00.124808+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":719,"images":17,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}